  "subject": "a Wan Chai pub darts team of six minibus drivers who need double-top with the last dart to win the Kowloon league final, and their thrower, who has never hit it sober, stuck on lemon tea because he drives the 5 a.m. first run",
  "caption": "Cantonese Britpop in the mid-90s guitar-band mould. Two electric guitars, one a jangly 12-string strum and one a crunchy overdriven rhythm wall, a Hammond organ swelling under the chorus, a melodic bass line moving against the chords, straight pounding drums with tambourine on every off-beat. Big, slightly compressed band-in-a-room sound, guitars panned wide, unpolished. A nasal male tenor with a lazy, swaggering drawl in the verses, opening into a full-throated terrace singalong on the chorus with friends joining in unison. 126 BPM, E major. Rowdy, laddish, silly and triumphant. No pop-punk, no emo, no autotune, no synth-pop, no EDM build.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n星期六晚 灣仔老酒吧\n九龍聯賽 決賽打到最尾\n六個揸小巴嘅 着住同款隊衫\n剩低四十分 一枝鏢 輪到阿華\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n佢話冇三支啤酒落肚 從來都未中過\n聽朝五點揸頭班車 今晚淨係飲檸檬茶\n\n[Chorus]\n雙倍二十 喺最頂\n阿華 你得㗎喇\n大埔道十八彎 你眼都唔眨\n一枝鏢 驚乜嘢\n\n[Verse]\n對面觀塘的士隊 笑到拍枱\n老闆偷偷推杯啤酒埋嚟\n佢推返轉頭 話聽朝要開工\n成間酒吧 靜到聽到雪櫃響\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n佢好似埋站咁 望一望倒後鏡\n吸一啖氣 等個綠燈\n\n[Chorus]\n雙倍二十 喺最頂\n阿華 全場望住你\n大埔道十八彎 你眼都唔眨\n清醒一鏢 驚乜嘢\n\n[Bridge]\n枝鏢飛出去 慢過紅隧塞車\n啪一聲 釘正最頂嗰條窄邊\n六個大男人 攬住跌落地\n\n[Chorus]\n中咗喇 雙倍二十\n阿華 你自己都唔信\n一滴酒都冇 照樣中\n九龍個盃 喺灣仔捧\n\n[Outro]\n聽朝五點 佢揸頭班車 一路唱\nDouble Top 喂 Double Top",
